{"id":"b1995c438a1cfa6f2e269d368e7d077c04984129","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246338","title":"建个站，要怎样的提示词或方法， gpt 可以自己做呢？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"weiqi554177834","excerpt":"程序员 - @weiqi554177834 - 只告诉我的想法，尽可能少的更改，能做出好的效果出来呢？求赐教","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/建站\"><li></li> 建站</a><a href=\"/tag/提示词\"><li></li> 提示词</a><a href=\"/tag/方法\"><li></li> 方法</a></P><p><span>17 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-04 17:50:58 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147257\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cbdc2d2abea269348d232f9f265e7072?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yuewolf\" data-uid=\"75037\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuewolf\">yuewolf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 09:19:09 +08:00\">22h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>问 AI ，和 AI 不断探讨，确定方案，试着做出来一版；继续讨论，修改……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147308\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7121/0eb9/222090_normal.png?m=1790992262\" alt=\"iorilu\" data-uid=\"222090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iorilu\">iorilu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 09:53:28 +08:00\">22h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>这问题...</p><p>当然看复杂度</p><p>你让 gpt 做个计算器, 应该一次性完成</p><p>你让 gpt 开发个微信, 那自然不可能一次性</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147424\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80ac/32fc/580231_normal.png?m=1755248272\" alt=\"ndxxx\" data-uid=\"580231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ndxxx\">ndxxx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 11:30:49 +08:00\">20h 36m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>淘宝网页版，小公司的官网，都是一个「站」，你觉得两者是一回事吗🤣</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147429\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bb3e/b7da/77488_normal.png?m=1505054432\" alt=\"moooookey\" data-uid=\"77488\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/moooookey\">moooookey</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 11:34:35 +08:00\">20h 32m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你说原始需求，让 AI 先出方案，你来选方案，方案确认了再落地</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147593\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a0a7da8499cec0f24992d81473febeb9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"z97s04\" data-uid=\"53178\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/z97s04\">z97s04</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 13:49:36 +08:00\">18h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一直按照需求提问就可以了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147657\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2fc1/5950/472493_normal.png?m=1584500692\" alt=\"agentd\" data-uid=\"472493\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/agentd\">agentd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 14:46:30 +08:00\">17h 21m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自己做两个出来吧，有手感了然后让 ai 自己总结</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147680\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9928/b5d8/828838_normal.png?m=1787375652\" alt=\"chjqpmain\" data-uid=\"828838\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chjqpmain\">chjqpmain</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 14:58:05 +08:00\">17h 9m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让模型多开，or 让模型教你理解同类型开源项目如何从 0 到 1 设计到实现到迭代，<br>然后再从 0 按照自己的理念设计</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147682\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1788532163\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a><